    "reference": "Existing ImageJ 1.54r oracle fixtures and historical expectations are unchanged. New regional checks use independent literal visible membership (8 cells, sum70), scalar/RGB mapping, and transport/storage invariants. Existing full-domain Apply regressions run alongside them; no new oracle acquisition is claimed.",
    "actual_ui": "Real pointer input clicks Auto and Apply in the shared ImGui contrast panel with a regional corner selection. The plot remains whole-plane; Auto captures V2 regional provenance; Apply maps visible cells and retains geometry with one undo step. Existing standalone probes are regressions, not new standalone off-image certification.",
